stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: create_run (connect / Sync now)
  pending --> running: worker starts indexing
  running --> succeeded: all threads indexed + checkpoint saved
  running --> pending: transient error (stage = retrying) or stalled > 15 min
  running --> failed: permanent error or last retry used up
  pending --> failed: stuck > 2 hours (processing_stalled)
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  note right of failed
    safe_error_code examples
    connection_needs_reauthorization
    provider_rate_limited
    processing_stalled
  end note
